{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drivers of the Apocalypse</strong> is a high-octane action-driving combat game set in a vast, treacherous wasteland. You step into the shoes of Artemis, a junior mercenary working for Thunder Strike Force. Your mission? Stop deadly convoys, defeat powerful bosses, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/209fc85ab42387d2b6aa775d6becf5d2.poster.avif?t=1772129037\" width=616 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/209fc85ab42387d2b6aa775d6becf5d2.webm?t=1772129037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art of Tactical Vehicle Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is all about strategy and precision\u2014steal weakened enemy vehicles, jump from car to car in mid-battle, and use each ride\u2019s strengths to your advantage. If your vehicle gets destroyed, don\u2019t worry. Simply leap to another and keep fighting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/aca07862387223ded6c56bbd6ecea525.poster.avif?t=1772129037\" width=616 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/aca07862387223ded6c56bbd6ecea525.webm?t=1772129037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battles on wheels Like No Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its fast-paced vehicle-swapping mechanic, <i>Drivers of the Apocalypse</i> offers a chaotic mix of driving and combat. The game features a series of epic boss encounters, challenging you to make quick decisions and master your driving skills as you take on the toughest road warriors in the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/7bc29af2bd6efffa948093843ab64ad6.poster.avif?t=1772129037\" width=616 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/7bc29af2bd6efffa948093843ab64ad6.webm?t=1772129037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Vehicle Combat:</strong> Switch between enemy vehicles on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Take down huge convoys and powerful leaders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-Apocalyptic World:</strong> Explore and conquer the wasteland, using cars as your ultimate weapon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3260240?t=1772129037","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3260240?t=1772129037","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/ad244797847711a378d32182c977426e60d8064d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772129037","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/ad244797847711a378d32182c977426e60d8064d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772129037","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drivers of the Apocalypse</strong> is a high-octane action-driving combat game set in a vast, treacherous wasteland. You step into the shoes of Artemis, a junior mercenary working for Thunder Strike Force. Your mission? Stop deadly convoys, defeat powerful bosses, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/209fc85ab42387d2b6aa775d6becf5d2.poster.avif?t=1772129037\" width=616 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/209fc85ab42387d2b6aa775d6becf5d2.webm?t=1772129037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art of Tactical Vehicle Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is all about strategy and precision\u2014steal weakened enemy vehicles, jump from car to car in mid-battle, and use each ride\u2019s strengths to your advantage. If your vehicle gets destroyed, don\u2019t worry. Simply leap to another and keep fighting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/aca07862387223ded6c56bbd6ecea525.poster.avif?t=1772129037\" width=616 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260240/extras/aca07862387223ded6c56bbd6ecea525.webm?t=1772129037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battles on wheels Like No Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its fast-paced vehicle-swapping mechanic, <i>Drivers of the Apocalypse</i> offers a chaotic mix of driving and combat. The game features a series of epic boss encounters, challenging you to make quick decisions and master your driving skills as you take on the toughest road warriors in the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl